  "overview": "This function constructs a formatted chat message representing a spell, utilizing World of Warcraft-style formatting codes for color and hyperlinking. It checks if the spell has an assigned rank; if so, it appends the rank to the spell name within the formatted string, otherwise it outputs only the base spell information.",
