  "returns": "bool",
  "side_effects": "I/O",
  "notes": "Returns true only if all operations succeed; returns false on empty input, missing items for withdrawal, or failure to find items for deposit."
}

src/strategy/actions/BankAction.cpp::Wit.raw:
