  "returns": "void",
  "side_effects": "Modifies the input string in-place; performs no I/O or network operations.",
  "notes": "Caller must ensure 's' is not empty before calling, as erase on an empty range is valid but erasing from begin to find_if (which returns begin) results in an empty string. Edge case: if the string contains only whitespace, it becomes empty."
