{
  "summary": "Executes a custom spell by parsing the event name to identify a target and selecting a valid spell from the player's inventory.",
  "overview": "This function retrieves the list of available spells for the bot and determines the target based on the provided event parameter or existing targets. It iterates through the spell map, filtering out invalid spells and those not castable by the bot, then prioritizes them by spell ID. The function randomly selects up to five candidate spells from the sorted list and attempts to cast each one until a successful cast occurs.",
