  "overview": "This function generates a standardized string output for logging or network transmission when a custom spell is cast upon a target entity. It combines the action identifier 'castnc' with a formatted representation of the target object, ensuring consistent data formatting across the game server. The resulting string is returned as a const reference to avoid unnecessary memory allocation.",
  "params": [
    {
      "name": "target",
      "desc": "Pointer to the WorldObject instance upon which the spell is being cast."
    }
  ],
  "returns": "std::string const",
