{
  "summary": "AcceptSpell validates whether a custom spell action can be executed by checking if the specified effect is an enchantment and has available reagents.",
  "overview": "This function determines if a CastCustomSpellAction is valid by examining the provided SpellInfo structure. It specifically checks if the first defined effect (EFFECT_0) corresponds to SPELL_EFFECT_ENCHANT_ITEM and ensures that at least one reagent exists for this effect. The function returns true only when both conditions are met, otherwise it returns false.",
  "params": [
    {
      "name": "spellInfo",
      "desc": "A pointer to the SpellInfo structure containing details about the spell, including its effects and required reagents."
