  ],
  "returns": "bool",
  "side_effects": "None",
  "notes": "The function relies on EFFECT_0 being the correct index for the enchantment effect; callers must ensure the spell definition matches this expectation. Edge cases include spells with no reagents or where the first effect is not an enchantment."
