  "overview": "This function evaluates a custom spell to determine its execution priority within the bot's action queue. It specifically checks if the spell targets an item enchantment that results in a skill increase, assigning it a high priority of 10 to ensure it runs before other actions. If no such condition is met, it defaults to a standard priority of 1.",
  "params": [
    {
      "name": "spellInfo",
